Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.56,Main,,0,0,330,,Brooo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:01.44,Main,,0,0,330,,Someone just built an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.80,Main,,0,0,970,,AI agent whose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:03.68,Main,,0,0,970,,only job is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:05.12,Highlight,,0,0,970,,finding you customers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:05.60,Main,,0,0,970,,It's called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:06.32,Highlight,,0,0,970,,Harvey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:06.80,Main,,0,0,970,,And it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:07.76,Highlight,,0,0,970,,open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:08.32,Main,,0,0,970,,You tell it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.12,Main,,0,0,970,,two things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:10.00,Main,,0,0,970,,What you sell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:10.96,Main,,0,0,970,,and who you want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:11.92,Main,,0,0,970,,to sell to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:12.72,Main,,0,0,330,,That's it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.60,Main,,0,0,970,,Then it goes off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.32,Main,,0,0,970,,on its own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.68,Main,,0,0,970,,finds those companies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:16.64,Main,,0,0,970,,reads their websites
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.28,Main,,0,0,970,,and digs out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.00,Main,,0,0,970,,the right people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.36,Main,,0,0,970,,and their emails
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.24,Main,,0,0,970,,Then it writes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:20.88,Main,,0,0,970,,each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.80,Main,,0,0,970,,a personal cold email
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.68,Main,,0,0,970,,Sends it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:25.04,Main,,0,0,970,,Replies when they reply
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.16,Main,,0,0,970,,And books the meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.12,Main,,0,0,970,,Every 15 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:28.08,Main,,0,0,970,,it wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.20,Main,,0,0,970,,does its work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:31.04,Main,,0,0,970,,and goes back to sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.72,Main,,0,0,330,,Basically a salesperson who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.92,Highlight,,0,0,330,,never takes leave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.04,Main,,0,0,970,,The code's free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.08,Main,,0,0,970,,It runs on your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:37.76,Main,,0,0,970,,Claude Max subscription
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.88,Main,,0,0,330,,Want the setup guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:39.28,Main,,0,0,330,,Comment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:39.76,Highlight,,0,0,330,,HARVEY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:42.47,Main,,0,0,330,,I'll DM it to you
